      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 7. **Coordinated Administration with HRA**. The AFCS, OCSE, the Head Start Program and Child Day Care Services units of AFCS, to the extent that the AFCS Commissioner determines it is appropriate, shall continue to have the benefit of, and access to all legal, administrative and support services currently provided to them by HRA, and HRA shall continue to provide such services to the AFCS, and OCSE, the Head Start Program and Child Day Care Services units of AFCS.",
